[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8821.23, "timestamp": "02:27:01", "text": "现在，你却在等待……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8825.07, "timestamp": "02:27:05", "text": "铁匠。好了，铁匠的活儿结束了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8827.55, "timestamp": "02:27:07", "text": "这里。所以，是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8832.03, "timestamp": "02:27:12", "text": "如果我想的话，我可以挽救它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8836.19, "timestamp": "02:27:16", "text": "但我不知道该怎么办"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8839.87, "timestamp": "02:27:19", "text": "那。我会挽救"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8847.03, "timestamp": "02:27:27", "text": "你。我其实不太想救你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8864.63, "timestamp": "02:27:44", "text": "某物？所以如果我升级它，功率就会提升。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8878.75, "timestamp": "02:27:58", "text": "它。没事的。向上"}]